{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/36/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"How precious is Thy grace, O God, and the children of man shelter in the shadow of Thy wings. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/36/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"They are refreshed by the felicity of Thy house and with the brook of Thy bliss dost Thou water them. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/36/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For with Thee is the source of life, in Thy light do we behold light. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/36/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Extend Thy grace to those who acknowledge Thee, and Thy charity to those who are of upright heart. "}
